{"ticker":"DUK","updated":"2026-10-23T22:53:19Z","profile":{"longName":"Duke Energy Corporation","shortName":"Duke Energy Corporation (Holdin","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.duke-energy.com","fullTimeEmployees":26441,"marketCap":97447182336,"trailingPE":18.82229,"forwardPE":17.432251,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.970679,"pegRatio":2.34,"targetMeanPrice":132.10526,"targetHighPrice":143.0,"targetLowPrice":121.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.011,"earningsGrowth":0.106,"grossMargins":0.51971,"operatingMargins":0.27503002,"profitMargins":0.15995,"totalRevenue":32803000320,"beta":0.345,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":134.49,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":112.4,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.46},"summary":"Duke Energy Corporation, through its subsidiaries, operates as an energy company in the United States. The company operates through two segments: Electric Utilities and Infrastructure (EU&I); and Gas Utilities and Infrastructure (GU&I). The EU&I segment generates, transmits, distributes, and sells electricity to customers in the Southeast and Midwest regions. It generates electricity through coal, hydroelectric, natural gas, oil, renewables, and nuclear fuel. This segment also engages in the wholesale of electricity to municipalities, electric cooperative utilities, and other load-serving entities. The GU&I segment distributes natural gas to customers in the residential, commercial, industrial, and power generation natural gas sectors; and invests in pipeline transmission projects, renewable natural gas projects, and natural gas storage facilities. The company was formerly known as Duke Energy Holding Corp. and changed its name to Duke Energy Corporation in April 2006. Duke Energy Corporation was founded in 1904 and is headquartered in Charlotte, North Carolina.","summary_zh":"杜克能源公司透過其子公司在美國作為一家能源公司運作。該公司透過兩個部門運作：電力公用事業和基礎設施部門（EU&I）；以及天然氣公用事業和基礎設施 (GU&I)。 EU&I 部門向東南部和中西部地區的客戶生產、傳輸、分配和銷售電力。它透過煤炭、水力發電、天然氣、石油、再生能源和核燃料發電。該部門也從事向市政當局、電力合作公用事業公司和其他負載服務實體的電力批發業務。 GU&I 部門向住宅、商業、工業和發電天然氣領域的客戶分銷天然氣；並投資管道輸送項目、再生天然氣項目和天然氣儲存設施。該公司前身為杜克能源控股公司，2006年4月更名為杜克能源公司。杜克能源公司成立於1904年，總部位於北卡羅來納州夏洛特。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":123.95,"h":124.22,"l":122.87,"c":123.11,"v":2454300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":123.0,"h":123.54,"l":122.1,"c":123.28,"v":3102000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":123.61,"h":123.85,"l":122.76,"c":123.68,"v":2560800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":123.3,"h":123.61,"l":122.25,"c":122.37,"v":2496500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":122.4,"h":123.19,"l":122.11,"c":122.49,"v":2151200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":122.46,"h":122.77,"l":121.37,"c":121.89,"v":2449100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":121.3,"h":121.89,"l":120.62,"c":121.5,"v":2152100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":122.2,"h":122.45,"l":120.38,"c":120.87,"v":3069700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":121.31,"h":121.48,"l":120.04,"c":120.61,"v":1980700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":120.4,"h":120.83,"l":119.76,"c":120.17,"v":3069000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":120.25,"h":121.03,"l":119.9,"c":120.38,"v":2182800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":120.41,"h":121.46,"l":120.2,"c":121.35,"v":2104400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":121.36,"h":122.23,"l":120.97,"c":122.11,"v":2178000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":122.08,"h":122.9,"l":121.87,"c":121.95,"v":2136400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":121.65,"h":122.65,"l":121.62,"c":122.37,"v":2202600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":122.63,"h":122.83,"l":120.2,"c":120.25,"v":4158400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":120.74,"h":121.5,"l":120.27,"c":121.1,"v":2437700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":120.03,"h":121.12,"l":119.69,"c":120.39,"v":2541100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":120.76,"h":121.65,"l":120.0,"c":121.08,"v":4842000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":121.21,"h":122.01,"l":120.73,"c":121.58,"v":2062000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":121.46,"h":123.24,"l":120.97,"c":123.1,"v":2123700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":123.0,"h":123.95,"l":122.95,"c":123.64,"v":2173100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":124.11,"h":124.3,"l":122.27,"c"